# Previously installed its own istio/cert-manager/external-secrets/keycloak
# (plus a letsencrypt-dns01 ClusterIssuer) for standalone clusters
# (local/ci/kind/development), reasoning "no forwardmeasure-platform
# install exists there to provide them." That reasoning had no actual
# backing: this repo's own acceptance test
# (deploy/acceptance/verify-k7.sh) explicitly asserts *zero* keycloak
# Deployments/StatefulSets for exactly those profiles - directly
# contradicted by what this file actually did. Removed entirely, not
# gated - forwardmeasure-platform (or an equivalent already-provisioned
# cluster) is required for OpenWorkflow's own core infrastructure needs
# under every environment, standalone included. This file now has nothing
# left to define.

releases: []
